(403,188,$mw$B0B79177F841CED7E80277AA60B4BF28981F747A2843D067A9C95704275D2D1E$mw$,$mw$6b96aa5003f8596b50b1e141d1f09288$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":188,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":2,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حل المعادلة \\(5x+7=37\\).","TitleEn":"Solve \\(5x+7=37\\).","QuestionTextAr":"حل المعادلة \\(5x+7=37\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Solve \\(5x+7=37\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: نستخدم العمليات العكسية لعزل المجهول، ونلغي الجمع قبل الضرب. في المعادلة 5س + 7 = 37 نطرح 7 من الطرفين، فنحصل على 5س = 30. ثم نقسم على 5: س = 30 ÷ 5 = 6. التحقق: 5 × 6 + 7 = 37.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Solve a two-step equation with inverse operations: undo addition, then multiplication. From 5x + 7 = 37, subtract 7 to obtain 5x = 30, then divide by 5: x = 30 ÷ 5 = 6. Check: 5 × 6 + 7 = 37.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":741,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":742,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":743,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":744,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بعزل الحد الذي يحتوي على المتغير.","En":"First isolate the term containing the variable."},{"Ar":"اطرح 7 من الطرفين، ثم اقسم على معامل المتغير.","En":"Subtract 7 from both sides, then divide by the coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حل المعادلة \\(5x+7=37\\).","En":"Solve \\(5x+7=37\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ9 يعطي 52، وليس 37.","En":"Substitution of 9 gives 52, not 37."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ4 يعطي 27، وليس 37.","En":"Substitution of 4 gives 27, not 37."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ7 يعطي 42، وليس 37.","En":"Substitution of 7 gives 42, not 37."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"حل المعادلة \\(5x+7=37\\).","En":"Solve \\(5x+7=37\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبدأ توازن المعادلة: نزيل الجمع أولاً ثم الضرب.","En":"Equation balance: undo addition before multiplication."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح 7 من الطرفين.","En":"Subtract 7 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم الطرفين على 5.","En":"Divide both sides by 5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس ترتيب العمليات دون مراعاة المعادلة.","En":"Do not undo operations in the wrong order."},"FormulaLatex":"ax+b=c\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{c-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5x=30\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{30}{5}=6$","En":"$5x=30\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{30}{5}=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5\\times6+7=37$","En":"$5\\times6+7=37$"}},"TrackIds":[6],"CategoryId":2,"PrimarySkillId":10,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بعزل الحد الذي يحتوي على المتغير.","En":"First isolate the term containing the variable."},{"Ar":"اطرح 7 من الطرفين، ثم اقسم على معامل المتغير.","En":"Subtract 7 from both sides, then divide by the coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبدأ توازن المعادلة: نزيل الجمع أولاً ثم الضرب.","En":"Equation balance: undo addition before multiplication."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح 7 من الطرفين.","En":"Subtract 7 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم الطرفين على 5.","En":"Divide both sides by 5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس ترتيب العمليات دون مراعاة المعادلة.","En":"Do not undo operations in the wrong order."},"FormulaLatex":"ax+b=c\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{c-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5x=30\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{30}{5}=6$","En":"$5x=30\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{30}{5}=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5\\times6+7=37$","En":"$5\\times6+7=37$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ9 يعطي 52، وليس 37.","En":"Substitution of 9 gives 52, not 37."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ4 يعطي 27، وليس 37.","En":"Substitution of 4 gives 27, not 37."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ7 يعطي 42، وليس 37.","En":"Substitution of 7 gives 42, not 37."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مبدأ توازن المعادلة: نزيل الجمع أولاً ثم الضرب.

$ax+b=c\Rightarrow x=\frac{c-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. اطرح 7 من الطرفين.

2. اقسم الطرفين على 5.

$5x=30\Rightarrow x=\frac{30}{5}=6$

$6$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5\times6+7=37$

لا تعكس ترتيب العمليات دون مراعاة المعادلة.$mw$,$mw$Equation balance: undo addition before multiplication.

$ax+b=c\Rightarrow x=\frac{c-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. Subtract 7 from both sides.

2. Divide both sides by 5.

$5x=30\Rightarrow x=\frac{30}{5}=6$

$6$ Dimensionless

$5\times6+7=37$

Do not undo operations in the wrong order.$mw$),
(413,200,$mw$1236EEB0B784390FAF0F3ED2B07B3C02201A24DD02152A8021B53F0C0EEFB87E$mw$,$mw$3d730675c340bbd6e56f7a655c7508ad$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":200,"StageId":1,"CategoryId":2,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حل المعادلة \\(6x+8=50\\).","TitleEn":"Solve \\(6x+8=50\\).","QuestionTextAr":"حل المعادلة \\(6x+8=50\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Solve \\(6x+8=50\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: نستخدم العمليات العكسية لعزل المجهول، ونلغي الجمع قبل الضرب. في المعادلة 6س + 8 = 50 نطرح 8 من الطرفين، فنحصل على 6س = 42. ثم نقسم على 6: س = 42 ÷ 6 = 7. التحقق: 6 × 7 + 8 = 50.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Solve a two-step equation with inverse operations: undo addition, then multiplication. From 6x + 8 = 50, subtract 8 to obtain 6x = 42, then divide by 6: x = 42 ÷ 6 = 7. Check: 6 × 7 + 8 = 50.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":789,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":790,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":791,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":792,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بعزل الحد الذي يحتوي على المتغير.","En":"First isolate the term containing the variable."},{"Ar":"اطرح 8 من الطرفين، ثم اقسم على معامل المتغير.","En":"Subtract 8 from both sides, then divide by the coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حل المعادلة \\(6x+8=50\\).","En":"Solve \\(6x+8=50\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ5 يعطي 38، وليس 50.","En":"Substitution of 5 gives 38, not 50."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"7"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ8 يعطي 56، وليس 50.","En":"Substitution of 8 gives 56, not 50."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"التعويض بـ10 يعطي 68، وليس 50.","En":"Substitution of 10 gives 68, not 50."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"10"}],"StageId":1,"Question":{"Ar":"حل المعا