(423,212,$mw$E7423B74CFB17589633ABACD31D72E4125EE374F1EBF00F67EF843E2D7557BA6$mw$,$mw$cf97e15b3f4e5f555bbc20348447c9cc$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":212,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"لتكن \\(f(x)=2x+5\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=11\\) فأوجد x.","TitleEn":"Given \\(f(x)=2x+5\\), solve f(x)=11.","QuestionTextAr":"لتكن \\(f(x)=2x+5\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=11\\) فأوجد x.","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(f(x)=2x+5\\), solve f(x)=11.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: حل f(س) = 11 يعني إيجاد المدخل الذي يجعل الدالة تساوي 11. لدينا f(س) = 2س + 5؛ نحل 2س + 5 = 11. نطرح 5: 2س = 6، ثم نقسم على 2: س = 6 ÷ 2 = 3. التحقق: 2 × 3 + 5 = 11.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Solving f(x) = 11 finds the input producing that output. With f(x) = 2x + 5, set 2x + 5 = 11. Subtract 5: 2x = 6, then divide by 2: x = 6 ÷ 2 = 3. Check: 2 × 3 + 5 = 11.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":837,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":838,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":839,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":840,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بكتابة معادلة تساوي الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.","En":"Start by equating the function expression with the given output."},{"Ar":"أزل الثابت ثم اقسم على معامل المتغير.","En":"Remove the constant, then divide by the variable coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"لتكن \\(f(x)=2x+5\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=11\\) فأوجد $x$.","En":"Given \\(f(x)=2x+5\\), solve $f(x)=11$."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"قيمة الدالة عند 1 هي 7 لا 11.","En":"The function at 1 equals 7, not 11."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"قيمة الدالة عند 4 هي 13 لا 11.","En":"The function at 4 equals 13, not 11."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"قيمة الدالة عند 6 هي 17 لا 11.","En":"The function at 6 equals 17, not 11."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"لتكن \\(f(x)=2x+5\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=11\\) فأوجد x.","En":"Given \\(f(x)=2x+5\\), solve f(x)=11."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"إيجاد المدخل من قيمة الدالة: نساوي التعبير بالمخرج ونحل المعادلة الخطية.","En":"Finding an input from a function value: set the expression equal to the output and solve the linear equation."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ساوِ التعبير بالقيمة 11 واطرح 5 من الطرفين.","En":"Set the expression equal to 11 and subtract 5 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم الطرفين على 2.","En":"Divide both sides by 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"المطلوب المدخل وليس قيمة الدالة المعطاة.","En":"The requested quantity is the input, not the given output."},"FormulaLatex":"f(x)=ax+b=y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=\\frac{11-5}{2}=3$","En":"$x=\\frac{11-5}{2}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\times3+5=11$","En":"$2\\times3+5=11$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":28,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بكتابة معادلة تساوي الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.","En":"Start by equating the function expression with the given output."},{"Ar":"أزل الثابت ثم اقسم على معامل المتغير.","En":"Remove the constant, then divide by the variable coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"إيجاد المدخل من قيمة الدالة: نساوي التعبير بالمخرج ونحل المعادلة الخطية.","En":"Finding an input from a function value: set the expression equal to the output and solve the linear equation."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ساوِ التعبير بالقيمة 11 واطرح 5 من الطرفين.","En":"Set the expression equal to 11 and subtract 5 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم الطرفين على 2.","En":"Divide both sides by 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"المطلوب المدخل وليس قيمة الدالة المعطاة.","En":"The requested quantity is the input, not the given output."},"FormulaLatex":"f(x)=ax+b=y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=\\frac{11-5}{2}=3$","En":"$x=\\frac{11-5}{2}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\times3+5=11$","En":"$2\\times3+5=11$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"قيمة الدالة عند 1 هي 7 لا 11.","En":"The function at 1 equals 7, not 11."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"قيمة الدالة عند 4 هي 13 لا 11.","En":"The function at 4 equals 13, not 11."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"قيمة الدالة عند 6 هي 17 لا 11.","En":"The function at 6 equals 17, not 11."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$إيجاد المدخل من قيمة الدالة: نساوي التعبير بالمخرج ونحل المعادلة الخطية.

$f(x)=ax+b=y\Rightarrow x=\frac{y-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. ساوِ التعبير بالقيمة 11 واطرح 5 من الطرفين.

2. اقسم الطرفين على 2.

$x=\frac{11-5}{2}=3$

$3$ بلا وحدة قياس

$2\times3+5=11$

المطلوب المدخل وليس قيمة الدالة المعطاة.$mw$,$mw$Finding an input from a function value: set the expression equal to the output and solve the linear equation.

$f(x)=ax+b=y\Rightarrow x=\frac{y-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. Set the expression equal to 11 and subtract 5 from both sides.

2. Divide both sides by 2.

$x=\frac{11-5}{2}=3$

$3$ Dimensionless

$2\times3+5=11$

The requested quantity is the input, not the given output.$mw$),
(424,213,$mw$6C267902F7726B44EA06A0AA9FECC4F48E26F3404CD4C7EBBCD14ACB4E10208F$mw$,$mw$3c920d1ef4690ff55e2c528df4224768$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":213,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (1،4) و(4،10)؟","TitleEn":"Find the slope between (1,4) and (4,10).","QuestionTextAr":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (1،4) و(4،10)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the slope between (1,4) and (4,10).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون ميل المستقيم بين نقطتين: م = (ص₂ − ص₁) ÷ (س₂ − س₁)، بشرط اختلاف الإحداثيين السينيين. بين (1،4) و(4،10) يكون التغير الرأسي = 10 − 4 = 6، والتغير الأفقي = 4 − 1 = 3. بالتعويض: الميل = 6 ÷ 3 = 2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Slope formula: m = (y₂ − y₁)/(x₂ − x₁) for points with different x-coordinates. Between (1, 4) and (4, 10), the rise is 10 − 4 = 6, and the run is 4 − 1 = 3. Thus m = 6 ÷ 3 = 2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":841,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":842,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":843,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":844,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"الميل يقارن التغير الرأسي بالتغير الأفقي.","En":"Slope compares vertical and horizontal changes."},{"Ar":"اطرح قيم $y$ في البسط وقيم $x$ في المقام بالترتيب نفسه.","En":"Subtract $y$-values in the numerator and $x$-values in the denominator in the same order."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (1،4) و(4،10)؟","En":"Find the slope between (1,4) and (4,10)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"2"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 3 يعني تغيراً رأسياً 9 وليس 6.","En":"A slope of 3 implies a vertical change of 9, not 6."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 5 يعني تغيراً رأسياً 15 وليس 6.","En":"A slope of 5 implies a vertical change of 15, not 6."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 0 يعني تغيراً رأسياً 0 وليس 6.","En":"A slope of 0 implies a vertical change of 0, not 6."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"0"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (1،4) و(4،10)؟","En":"Find the slope between (1,4) and (4,10)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الميل هو نسبة التغير في $y$ إلى التغير في $x$، بشرط ألا يكون التغير الأفقي صفراً.","En":"Slope is the change in $y$ divided by the change in $x$, provided the horizontal change is nonzero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب التغير الرأسي: $10-4=6$.","En":"Compute the vertical change: $10-4=6$."},{"Ar":"احسب التغير الأفقي: $4-1=3$.","En":"Compute the horizontal change: $4-1=3$."},{"Ar":"اقسم التغير الرأسي على التغير الأفقي.","En":"Divide the vertical change by the horizontal change."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو ترتيب النقطتين في أحد الفرقين.","En":"Do not swap numerator and denominator or reverse only one coordinate difference."},"FormulaLatex":"m=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\quad(x_2\\ne x_1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$m=\\frac{10-4}{4-1}=2$","En":"$m=\\frac{10-4}{4-1}=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\times(4-1)=6$","En":"$2\\times(4-1)=6$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":29,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"الميل يقارن التغير الرأسي بالتغير الأفقي.","En":"Slope compares vertical and horizontal changes."},{"Ar":"اطرح قيم $y$ في البسط وقيم $x$ في المقام بالترتيب نفسه.","En":"Subtract $y$-values in the numerator and $x$-values in the denominator in the same order."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الميل هو نسبة التغير في $y$ إلى التغير في $x$، بشرط ألا يكون التغير الأفقي صفراً.","En":"Slope is the change in $y$ divided by the change in $x$, provided the horizontal change is nonzero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب التغير الرأسي: $10-4=6$.","En":"Compute the vertical change: $10-4=6$."},{"Ar":"احسب التغير الأفقي: $4-1=3$.","En":"Compute the horizontal change: $4-1=3$."},{"Ar":"اقسم التغير الرأسي على التغير الأفقي.","En":"Divide the vertical change by the horizontal change."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$2$","En":"$2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو ترتيب النقطتين في أحد الفرقين.","En":"Do not swap numerator and denominator or reverse only one coordinate difference."},"FormulaLatex":"m=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\quad(x_2\\ne x_1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$m=\\frac{10-4}{4-1}=2$","En":"$m=\\frac{10-4}{4-1}=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\times(4-1)=6$","En":"$2\\times(4-1)=6$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 3 يعني تغيراً رأسياً 9 وليس 6.","En":"A slope of 3 implies a vertical change of 9, not 6."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 5 يعني تغيراً رأسياً 15 وليس 6.","En":"A slope of 5 implies a vertical change of 15, not 6."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 0 يعني تغيراً رأسياً 0 وليس 6.","En":"A slope of 0 implies a vertical change of 0, not 6."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الميل هو نسبة التغير في $y$ إلى التغير في $x$، بشرط ألا يكون التغير الأفقي صفراً.

$m=\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\quad(x_2\ne x_1)$

1. احسب التغير الرأسي: $10-4=6$.

2. احسب التغير الأفقي: $4-1=3$.

3. اقسم التغير الرأسي على التغير الأفقي.

$m=\frac{10-4}{4-1}=2$

$2$ بلا وحدة قياس

$2\times(4-1)=6$

لا تعكس البسط والمقام أو ترتيب النقطتين في أحد الفرقين.$mw$,$mw$Slope is the change in $y$ divided by the change in $x$, provided the horizontal change is nonzero.

$m=\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\quad(x_2\ne x_1)$

1. Compute the vertical change: $10-4=6$.

2. Compute the horizontal change: $4-1=3$.

3. Divide the vertical change by the horizontal change.

$m=\frac{10-4}{4-1}=2$

$2$ Dimensionless

$2\times(4-1)=6$

Do not swap numerator and denominator or reverse only one coordinate difference.$mw$),
(425,214,$mw$CA93756CE5CB96861C67D96F9F284A7EC6C65978FF483B487CB95B078108F6B2$mw$,$mw$a741ef85b3d66a425d35d301f7fb8c99$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":214,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\)، أوجد \\(g(2)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\), find g(2).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\)، أوجد \\(g(2)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\), find g(2).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: عند حساب دالة تربيعية نبدأ بالتعويض ثم الأس، وبعده الضرب وأخيراً الجمع. للدالة g(س) = 2س² + 3 عند س = 2: ‏g(2) = 2 × 2² + 3 = 2 × 4 + 3 = 8 + 3 = 11.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: For a quadratic function, substitute first, evaluate the exponent, multiply, then add. With g(x) = 2x² + 3 and x = 2, g(2) = 2 × 2² + 3 = 2 × 4 + 3 = 8 + 3 = 11.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":845,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":846,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"14","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":847,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":848,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"عوّض العدد المعطى في الدالة.","En":"Substitute the given input into the function."},{"Ar":"احسب مربع المدخل أولاً، ثم أكمل الضرب والجمع أو الطرح.","En":"Square the input first, then complete multiplication and addition or subtraction."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\)، أوجد \\(g(2)\\).","En":"Given \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\), find $g(2)$."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"بعد عزل الحد التربيعي من 12 نحصل على 9 لا 8.","En":"Removing the constant from 12 gives 9, not 8."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"12"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بعد عزل الحد التربيعي من 14 نحصل على 11 لا 8.","En":"Removing the constant from 14 gives 11, not 8."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"14"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"بعد عزل الحد التربيعي من 9 نحصل على 6 لا 8.","En":"Removing the constant from 9 gives 6, not 8."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"11"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\)، أوجد \\(g(2)\\).","En":"Given \\(g(x)=2x^2+3\\), find g(2)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعوض قيمة المدخل في الدالة التربيعية، ونحسب القوة قبل الضرب والجمع.","En":"Substitute the input in the quadratic function, evaluating the power before multiplication and addition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عوّض $x=2$ واحسب $2^2=4$.","En":"Substitute $x=2$ and calculate $2^2=4$."},{"Ar":"اضرب المربع في المعامل: $2\\times4=8$.","En":"Multiply the square by the coefficient: $2\\times4=8$."},{"Ar":"أضف الحد الثابت $3$.","En":"Add the constant $3$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$11$","En":"$11$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين التربيع والضرب في اثنين.","En":"Do not confuse squaring with multiplying by two."},"FormulaLatex":"g(x)=ax^2+c","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\times2^2+3=11$","En":"$2\\times2^2+3=11$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{11-3}{2}=4=2^2$","En":"$\\frac{11-3}{2}=4=2^2$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":27,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"عوّض العدد المعطى في الدالة.","En":"Substitute the given input into the function."},{"Ar":"احسب مربع المدخل أولاً، ثم أكمل الضرب والجمع أو الطرح.","En":"Square the input first, then complete multiplication and addition or subtraction."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعوض قيمة المدخل في الدالة التربيعية، ونحسب القوة قبل الضرب والجمع.","En":"Substitute the input in the quadratic function, evaluating the power before multiplication and addition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عوّض $x=2$ واحسب $2^2=4$.","En":"Substitute $x=2$ and calculate $2^2=4$."},{"Ar":"اضرب المربع في المعامل: $2\\times4=8$.","En":"Multiply the square by the coefficient: $2\\times4=8$."},{"Ar":"أضف الحد الثابت $3$.","En":"Add the constant $3$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$11$","En":"$11$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين التربيع والضرب في اثنين.","En":"Do not confuse squaring with multiplying by two."},"FormulaLatex":"g(x)=ax^2+c","Substitution":{"Ar":"$2\\times2^2+3=11$","En":"$2\\times2^2+3=11$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{11-3}{2}=4=2^2$","En":"$\\frac{11-3}{2}=4=2^2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد عزل الحد التربيعي من 12 نحصل على 9 لا 8.","En":"Removing the constant from 12 gives 9, not 8."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد عزل الحد التربيعي من 14 نحصل على 11 لا 8.","En":"Removing the constant from 14 gives 11, not 8."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"بعد عزل الحد التربيعي من 9 نحصل على 6 لا 8.","En":"Removing the constant from 9 gives 6, not 8."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نعوض قيمة المدخل في الدالة التربيعية، ونحسب القوة قبل الضرب والجمع.

$g(x)=ax^2+c$

1. عوّض $x=2$ واحسب $2^2=4$.

2. اضرب المربع في المعامل: $2\times4=8$.

3. أضف الحد الثابت $3$.

$2\times2^2+3=11$

$11$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{11-3}{2}=4=2^2$

لا تخلط بين التربيع والضرب في اثنين.$mw$,$mw$Substitute the input in the quadratic function, evaluating the power before multiplication and addition.

$g(x)=ax^2+c$

1. Substitute $x=2$ and calculate $2^2=4$.

2. Multiply the square by the coefficient: $2\times4=8$.

3. Add the constant $3$.

$2\times2^2+3=11$

$11$ Dimensionless

$\frac{11-3}{2}=4=2^2$

Do not confuse squaring with multiplying by two.$mw$),
(435,224,$mw$FEC1F34694EA7DB6D1F5C3E448002FE8E7EE2F1DEB1BC21FE4825CAA9100E7CE$mw$,$mw$d71866affe01ed5b0e3b73c3287d5a16$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":224,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"لتكن \\(f(x)=3x+6\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=18\\) فأوجد x.","TitleEn":"Given \\(f(x)=3x+6\\), solve f(x)=18.","QuestionTextAr":"لتكن \\(f(x)=3x+6\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=18\\) فأوجد x.","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(f(x)=3x+6\\), solve f(x)=18.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: حل f(س) = 18 يعني إيجاد المدخل الذي يجعل الدالة تساوي 18. لدينا f(س) = 3س + 6؛ نحل 3س + 6 = 18. نطرح 6: 3س = 12، ثم نقسم على 3: س = 12 ÷ 3 = 4. التحقق: 3 × 4 + 6 = 18.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Solving f(x) = 18 finds the input producing that output. With f(x) = 3x + 6, set 3x + 6 = 18. Subtract 6: 3x = 12, then divide by 3: x = 12 ÷ 3 = 4. Check: 3 × 4 + 6 = 18.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":885,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":886,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":887,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":888,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل قيمة الدالة المعطاة إلى معادلة.","En":"Turn the given function value into an equation."},{"Ar":"أزل الحد الثابت ثم اقسم الطرفين على المعامل.","En":"Remove the constant and divide both sides by the coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"لتكن \\(f(x)=3x+6\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=18\\) فأوجد $x$.","En":"Given \\(f(x)=3x+6\\), solve $f(x)=18$."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 5 تعطي 21 لا 18.","En":"The function at 5 gives 21, not 18."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 7 تعطي 27 لا 18.","En":"The function at 7 gives 27, not 18."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 2 تعطي 12 لا 18.","En":"The function at 2 gives 12, not 18."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"لتكن \\(f(x)=3x+6\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=18\\) فأوجد x.","En":"Given \\(f(x)=3x+6\\), solve f(x)=18."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لإيجاد المدخل من المخرج نحل المعادلة الخطية الناتجة عن مساواة الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.","En":"To find the input from an output, solve the linear equation obtained by equating the function with the given value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح 6 من طرفي المعادلة.","En":"Subtract 6 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم على المعامل 3.","En":"Divide by the coefficient 3."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المدخل المجهول بالمخرج المعطى.","En":"Do not confuse the unknown input with the given output."},"FormulaLatex":"ax+b=y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=\\frac{18-6}{3}=4$","En":"$x=\\frac{18-6}{3}=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times4+6=18$","En":"$3\\times4+6=18$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":28,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل قيمة الدالة المعطاة إلى معادلة.","En":"Turn the given function value into an equation."},{"Ar":"أزل الحد الثابت ثم اقسم الطرفين على المعامل.","En":"Remove the constant and divide both sides by the coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لإيجاد المدخل من المخرج نحل المعادلة الخطية الناتجة عن مساواة الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.","En":"To find the input from an output, solve the linear equation obtained by equating the function with the given value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح 6 من طرفي المعادلة.","En":"Subtract 6 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم على المعامل 3.","En":"Divide by the coefficient 3."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المدخل المجهول بالمخرج المعطى.","En":"Do not confuse the unknown input with the given output."},"FormulaLatex":"ax+b=y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=\\frac{18-6}{3}=4$","En":"$x=\\frac{18-6}{3}=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times4+6=18$","En":"$3\\times4+6=18$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 5 تعطي 21 لا 18.","En":"The function at 5 gives 21, not 18."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 7 تعطي 27 لا 18.","En":"The function at 7 gives 27, not 18."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 2 تعطي 12 لا 18.","En":"The function at 2 gives 12, not 18."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$لإيجاد المدخل من المخرج نحل المعادلة الخطية الناتجة عن مساواة الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.

$ax+b=y\Rightarrow x=\frac{y-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. اطرح 6 من طرفي المعادلة.

2. اقسم على المعامل 3.

$x=\frac{18-6}{3}=4$

$4$ بلا وحدة قياس

$3\times4+6=18$

لا تخلط المدخل المجهول بالمخرج المعطى.$mw$,$mw$To find the input from an output, solve the linear equation obtained by equating the function with the given value.

$ax+b=y\Rightarrow x=\frac{y-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. Subtract 6 from both sides.

2. Divide by the coefficient 3.

$x=\frac{18-6}{3}=4$

$4$ Dimensionless

$3\times4+6=18$

Do not confuse the unknown input with the given output.$mw$),
(436,225,$mw$AEC3E11C8B3EDD80A4E9B33A743BE57E939209A173E6F8CE819131CEF7AA7E4D$mw$,$mw$0cf709c0a9ffb35f0972e613c6096f75$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":225,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (2،5) و(6،17)؟","TitleEn":"Find the slope between (2,5) and (6,17).","QuestionTextAr":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (2،5) و(6،17)؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the slope between (2,5) and (6,17).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون ميل المستقيم بين نقطتين: م = (ص₂ − ص₁) ÷ (س₂ − س₁)، بشرط اختلاف الإحداثيين السينيين. بين (2،5) و(6،17) يكون التغير الرأسي = 17 − 5 = 12، والتغير الأفقي = 6 − 2 = 4. بالتعويض: الميل = 12 ÷ 4 = 3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Slope formula: m = (y₂ − y₁)/(x₂ − x₁) for points with different x-coordinates. Between (2, 5) and (6, 17), the rise is 17 − 5 = 12, and the run is 6 − 2 = 4. Thus m = 12 ÷ 4 = 3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":889,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":890,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":891,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":892,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"الميل يقارن التغير الرأسي بالأفقي.","En":"Slope compares vertical and horizontal changes."},{"Ar":"اطرح قيم $y$ في البسط وقيم $x$ في المقام بالترتيب نفسه.","En":"Subtract $y$-values in the numerator and $x$-values in the denominator in the same order."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (2،5) و(6،17)؟","En":"Find the slope between (2,5) and (6,17)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 4 يعطي تغيراً رأسياً 16 بدلاً من 12.","En":"Slope 4 gives a vertical change of 16 instead of 12."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 6 يعطي تغيراً رأسياً 24 بدلاً من 12.","En":"Slope 6 gives a vertical change of 24 instead of 12."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 1 يعطي تغيراً رأسياً 4 بدلاً من 12.","En":"Slope 1 gives a vertical change of 4 instead of 12."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"3"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما ميل المستقيم المار بالنقطتين (2،5) و(6،17)؟","En":"Find the slope between (2,5) and (6,17)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الميل هو نسبة التغير في $y$ إلى التغير في $x$، بشرط ألا يكون التغير الأفقي صفراً.","En":"Slope is the change in $y$ divided by the change in $x$, provided the horizontal change is nonzero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب التغير الرأسي: $17-5=12$.","En":"Compute the vertical change: $17-5=12$."},{"Ar":"احسب التغير الأفقي: $6-2=4$.","En":"Compute the horizontal change: $6-2=4$."},{"Ar":"اقسم التغير الرأسي على التغير الأفقي.","En":"Divide the vertical change by the horizontal change."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس ترتيب الطرح في فرق واحد فقط ولا تقلب الكسر.","En":"Do not reverse only one difference or invert the fraction."},"FormulaLatex":"m=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\quad(x_2\\ne x_1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{17-5}{6-2}=\\frac{12}{4}=3$","En":"$\\frac{17-5}{6-2}=\\frac{12}{4}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times4=12$","En":"$3\\times4=12$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":29,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"الميل يقارن التغير الرأسي بالأفقي.","En":"Slope compares vertical and horizontal changes."},{"Ar":"اطرح قيم $y$ في البسط وقيم $x$ في المقام بالترتيب نفسه.","En":"Subtract $y$-values in the numerator and $x$-values in the denominator in the same order."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الميل هو نسبة التغير في $y$ إلى التغير في $x$، بشرط ألا يكون التغير الأفقي صفراً.","En":"Slope is the change in $y$ divided by the change in $x$, provided the horizontal change is nonzero."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"احسب التغير الرأسي: $17-5=12$.","En":"Compute the vertical change: $17-5=12$."},{"Ar":"احسب التغير الأفقي: $6-2=4$.","En":"Compute the horizontal change: $6-2=4$."},{"Ar":"اقسم التغير الرأسي على التغير الأفقي.","En":"Divide the vertical change by the horizontal change."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس ترتيب الطرح في فرق واحد فقط ولا تقلب الكسر.","En":"Do not reverse only one difference or invert the fraction."},"FormulaLatex":"m=\\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\\quad(x_2\\ne x_1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{17-5}{6-2}=\\frac{12}{4}=3$","En":"$\\frac{17-5}{6-2}=\\frac{12}{4}=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times4=12$","En":"$3\\times4=12$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 4 يعطي تغيراً رأسياً 16 بدلاً من 12.","En":"Slope 4 gives a vertical change of 16 instead of 12."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 6 يعطي تغيراً رأسياً 24 بدلاً من 12.","En":"Slope 6 gives a vertical change of 24 instead of 12."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ميل 1 يعطي تغيراً رأسياً 4 بدلاً من 12.","En":"Slope 1 gives a vertical change of 4 instead of 12."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الميل هو نسبة التغير في $y$ إلى التغير في $x$، بشرط ألا يكون التغير الأفقي صفراً.

$m=\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\quad(x_2\ne x_1)$

1. احسب التغير الرأسي: $17-5=12$.

2. احسب التغير الأفقي: $6-2=4$.

3. اقسم التغير الرأسي على التغير الأفقي.

$\frac{17-5}{6-2}=\frac{12}{4}=3$

$3$ بلا وحدة قياس

$3\times4=12$

لا تعكس ترتيب الطرح في فرق واحد فقط ولا تقلب الكسر.$mw$,$mw$Slope is the change in $y$ divided by the change in $x$, provided the horizontal change is nonzero.

$m=\frac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1}\quad(x_2\ne x_1)$

1. Compute the vertical change: $17-5=12$.

2. Compute the horizontal change: $6-2=4$.

3. Divide the vertical change by the horizontal change.

$\frac{17-5}{6-2}=\frac{12}{4}=3$

$3$ Dimensionless

$3\times4=12$

Do not reverse only one difference or invert the fraction.$mw$),
(437,226,$mw$92F2B54D4E304A5B253F46FDF6E3B065CE75EB206C053544DC93AE86C9735AF1$mw$,$mw$b74fc9f1271282a60b93224453782d34$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":226,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\)، أوجد \\(g(3)\\).","TitleEn":"Given \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\), find g(3).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\)، أوجد \\(g(3)\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\), find g(3).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: عند حساب دالة تربيعية نبدأ بالتعويض ثم الأس، وبعده الضرب وأخيراً الجمع. للدالة g(س) = 3س² + 4 عند س = 3: ‏g(3) = 3 × 3² + 4 = 3 × 9 + 4 = 27 + 4 = 31.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: For a quadratic function, substitute first, evaluate the exponent, multiply, then add. With g(x) = 3x² + 4 and x = 3, g(3) = 3 × 3² + 4 = 3 × 9 + 4 = 27 + 4 = 31.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":893,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"34","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":894,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"29","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":895,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"31","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":896,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"32","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بالتعويض عن المتغير.","En":"Start by substituting the input."},{"Ar":"احسب المربع ثم الضرب قبل إضافة الحد الثابت.","En":"Evaluate the square, then multiplication, before adding the constant."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\)، أوجد \\(g(3)\\).","En":"Given \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\), find $g(3)$."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"طرح الثابت من 34 يعطي 30 لا الحد التربيعي 27.","En":"Subtracting the constant from 34 gives 30, not the quadratic term 27."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"34"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"طرح الثابت من 29 يعطي 25 لا الحد التربيعي 27.","En":"Subtracting the constant from 29 gives 25, not the quadratic term 27."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"29"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"31"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"طرح الثابت من 32 يعطي 28 لا الحد التربيعي 27.","En":"Subtracting the constant from 32 gives 28, not the quadratic term 27."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"32"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كانت \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\)، أوجد \\(g(3)\\).","En":"Given \\(g(x)=3x^2+4\\), find g(3)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعوّض قيمة المتغير في الدالة التربيعية ونحسب القوة قبل الضرب والجمع.","En":"Substitute the input in the quadratic function and evaluate the power before multiplication and addition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عوّض $x=3$ واحسب $3^2=9$.","En":"Substitute $x=3$ and calculate $3^2=9$."},{"Ar":"اضرب المربع في المعامل: $3\\times9=27$.","En":"Multiply the square by the coefficient: $3\\times9=27$."},{"Ar":"أضف الحد الثابت $4$.","En":"Add the constant $4$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$31$","En":"$31$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستبدل التربيع بالضرب في اثنين.","En":"Do not replace squaring with multiplication by two."},"FormulaLatex":"g(x)=ax^2+c","Substitution":{"Ar":"$g(3)=3\\times3^2+4=27+4=31$","En":"$g(3)=3\\times3^2+4=27+4=31$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{31-4}{3}=9=3^2$","En":"$\\frac{31-4}{3}=9=3^2$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":27,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بالتعويض عن المتغير.","En":"Start by substituting the input."},{"Ar":"احسب المربع ثم الضرب قبل إضافة الحد الثابت.","En":"Evaluate the square, then multiplication, before adding the constant."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعوّض قيمة المتغير في الدالة التربيعية ونحسب القوة قبل الضرب والجمع.","En":"Substitute the input in the quadratic function and evaluate the power before multiplication and addition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عوّض $x=3$ واحسب $3^2=9$.","En":"Substitute $x=3$ and calculate $3^2=9$."},{"Ar":"اضرب المربع في المعامل: $3\\times9=27$.","En":"Multiply the square by the coefficient: $3\\times9=27$."},{"Ar":"أضف الحد الثابت $4$.","En":"Add the constant $4$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$31$","En":"$31$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستبدل التربيع بالضرب في اثنين.","En":"Do not replace squaring with multiplication by two."},"FormulaLatex":"g(x)=ax^2+c","Substitution":{"Ar":"$g(3)=3\\times3^2+4=27+4=31$","En":"$g(3)=3\\times3^2+4=27+4=31$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{31-4}{3}=9=3^2$","En":"$\\frac{31-4}{3}=9=3^2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"طرح الثابت من 34 يعطي 30 لا الحد التربيعي 27.","En":"Subtracting the constant from 34 gives 30, not the quadratic term 27."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"طرح الثابت من 29 يعطي 25 لا الحد التربيعي 27.","En":"Subtracting the constant from 29 gives 25, not the quadratic term 27."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"طرح الثابت من 32 يعطي 28 لا الحد التربيعي 27.","En":"Subtracting the constant from 32 gives 28, not the quadratic term 27."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نعوّض قيمة المتغير في الدالة التربيعية ونحسب القوة قبل الضرب والجمع.

$g(x)=ax^2+c$

1. عوّض $x=3$ واحسب $3^2=9$.

2. اضرب المربع في المعامل: $3\times9=27$.

3. أضف الحد الثابت $4$.

$g(3)=3\times3^2+4=27+4=31$

$31$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{31-4}{3}=9=3^2$

لا تستبدل التربيع بالضرب في اثنين.$mw$,$mw$Substitute the input in the quadratic function and evaluate the power before multiplication and addition.

$g(x)=ax^2+c$

1. Substitute $x=3$ and calculate $3^2=9$.

2. Multiply the square by the coefficient: $3\times9=27$.

3. Add the constant $4$.

$g(3)=3\times3^2+4=27+4=31$

$31$ Dimensionless

$\frac{31-4}{3}=9=3^2$

Do not replace squaring with multiplication by two.$mw$),
(447,236,$mw$7417EDABA83A5EBBC34E37ADBB1C0F61FE5C088C6B4631F16E0889C5CC86105B$mw$,$mw$1cd1b51eb3f100d6ba7187b48a1d5e22$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":236,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"لتكن \\(f(x)=4x+7\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=27\\) فأوجد x.","TitleEn":"Given \\(f(x)=4x+7\\), solve f(x)=27.","QuestionTextAr":"لتكن \\(f(x)=4x+7\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=27\\) فأوجد x.","QuestionTextEn":"Given \\(f(x)=4x+7\\), solve f(x)=27.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: حل f(س) = 27 يعني إيجاد المدخل الذي يجعل الدالة تساوي 27. لدينا f(س) = 4س + 7؛ نحل 4س + 7 = 27. نطرح 7: 4س = 20، ثم نقسم على 4: س = 20 ÷ 4 = 5. التحقق: 4 × 5 + 7 = 27.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Solving f(x) = 27 finds the input producing that output. With f(x) = 4x + 7, set 4x + 7 = 27. Subtract 7: 4x = 20, then divide by 4: x = 20 ÷ 4 = 5. Check: 4 × 5 + 7 = 27.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":933,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":934,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":935,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":936,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل قيمة الدالة المعطاة إلى معادلة.","En":"Turn the given function value into an equation."},{"Ar":"أزل الحد الثابت ثم اقسم الطرفين على المعامل.","En":"Remove the constant and divide both sides by the coefficient."}],"Title":{"Ar":"لتكن \\(f(x)=4x+7\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=27\\) فأوجد $x$.","En":"Given \\(f(x)=4x+7\\), solve $f(x)=27$."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 6 تعطي 31 لا 27.","En":"The function at 6 gives 31, not 27."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 8 تعطي 39 لا 27.","En":"The function at 8 gives 39, not 27."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 3 تعطي 19 لا 27.","En":"The function at 3 gives 19, not 27."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"5"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"لتكن \\(f(x)=4x+7\\)، إذا كانت \\(f(x)=27\\) فأوجد x.","En":"Given \\(f(x)=4x+7\\), solve f(x)=27."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لإيجاد المدخل من المخرج نحل المعادلة الخطية الناتجة عن مساواة الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.","En":"To find the input from an output, solve the linear equation obtained by equating the function with the given value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح 7 من طرفي المعادلة.","En":"Subtract 7 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم على المعامل 4.","En":"Divide by the coefficient 4."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المدخل المجهول بالمخرج المعطى.","En":"Do not confuse the unknown input with the given output."},"FormulaLatex":"ax+b=y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=\\frac{27-7}{4}=5$","En":"$x=\\frac{27-7}{4}=5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4\\times5+7=27$","En":"$4\\times5+7=27$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":28,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل قيمة الدالة المعطاة إلى معادلة.","En":"Turn the given function value into an equation."},{"Ar":"أزل الحد الثابت ثم اقسم الطرفين على المعامل.","En":"Remove the constant and divide both sides by the coefficient."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"لإيجاد المدخل من المخرج نحل المعادلة الخطية الناتجة عن مساواة الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.","En":"To find the input from an output, solve the linear equation obtained by equating the function with the given value."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"اطرح 7 من طرفي المعادلة.","En":"Subtract 7 from both sides."},{"Ar":"اقسم على المعامل 4.","En":"Divide by the coefficient 4."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المدخل المجهول بالمخرج المعطى.","En":"Do not confuse the unknown input with the given output."},"FormulaLatex":"ax+b=y\\Rightarrow x=\\frac{y-b}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=\\frac{27-7}{4}=5$","En":"$x=\\frac{27-7}{4}=5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4\\times5+7=27$","En":"$4\\times5+7=27$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 6 تعطي 31 لا 27.","En":"The function at 6 gives 31, not 27."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 8 تعطي 39 لا 27.","En":"The function at 8 gives 39, not 27."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الدالة عند 3 تعطي 19 لا 27.","En":"The function at 3 gives 19, not 27."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$لإيجاد المدخل من المخرج نحل المعادلة الخطية الناتجة عن مساواة الدالة بالقيمة المعطاة.

$ax+b=y\Rightarrow x=\frac{y-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. اطرح 7 من طرفي المعادلة.

2. اقسم على المعامل 4.

$x=\frac{27-7}{4}=5$

$5$ بلا وحدة قياس

$4\times5+7=27$

لا تخلط المدخل المجهول بالمخرج المعطى.$mw$,$mw$To find the input from an output, solve the linear equation obtained by equating the function with the given value.

$ax+b=y\Rightarrow x=\frac{y-b}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. Subtract 7 from both sides.

2. Divide by the coefficient 4.

$x=\frac{27-7}{4}=5$

$5$ Dimensionless

$4\times5+7=27$

Do not confuse the unknown input with the given output.$mw$);
